Subject: [PATCH] Support Windows ARM64 in Bazel dependencies

Add the Windows ARM64 Python lock mapping and adapt gflags, Boost,
OpenCensus, and gRPC dependencies. These changes apply on all hosts;
their platform-specific behavior is selected inside Bazel.

diff --git a/WORKSPACE b/WORKSPACE
index d150d75..c2b4aca 100644
--- a/WORKSPACE
+++ b/WORKSPACE
@@ -172,6 +172,9 @@ load("@rules_python//python:pip.bzl", "pip_parse")
 pip_parse(
     name = "py_deps_py310",
     python_interpreter_target = python310,
+    requirements_by_platform = {
+        "//release:requirements_py310.txt": "windows_aarch64",
+    },
     requirements_lock = "//release:requirements_py310.txt",
 )
 
